# Outfit head (R18): a wraparound cyber visor band with a glowing slit, an ear module and a short antenna.
# Head frame as outfit_goggles (the head fills x 1..6, y 1..5, z 0..5).
name outfit_cybervisor
grid 5
size 7 6 7
slot band Steel
slot glow SwatchGlow
slot ear SwatchAccent
box 1 0 2 7 6 4 band
carve box 1 1 2 6 5 4
paint box 6 0 2 7 6 3 glow
paint box 4 0 2 6 1 3 glow
paint box 4 5 2 6 6 3 glow
box 2 5 1 4 6 4 ear
box 2 5 4 3 6 6 band
box 2 5 6 3 6 7 glow
pivot 3 3 0
